    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Permute the states of a particle. This might be useful when trying to sample from a too large set of <ref refid="namespaceIMP_1_1domino_1a3419fc2c9def4e8cfe47550df045e24c" kindref="member">Assignments</ref>. However, it will break many filters, so use with care. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
